  "details": "In real life, I have a Ricoh Theta which I can use to take spherical photographs from the point the camera is at, which includes myself.\n\nIt would be really nice if we had a virtual camera inside VRChat which could take spherical photos, which could even be taken in 3D, much like the current panoramas. The difference from normal panoramas is that you get to choose where you want to shoot from, so your entire body can be in the shot.",
